{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6cd4eccb-ab41-4e4d-81fe-7bb8e7e33234",
    "name": "SOAT Fase 4 — Billing Service",
    "description": "Orçamento e pagamento (Mercado Pago). Os orçamentos chegam pela Saga (comando billing.generate-quote.v1 do OS); o cliente consulta, aprova ou recusa com o JWT emitido pela Auth Function. A collection completa da jornada está em JoaoGW/soat-api (docs/postman/fase4-microsservicos.postman_collection.json).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "billingBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3002"
    },
    {
      "key": "clienteToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "osId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "orcamentoId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "cobrancaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mpSimuladorUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3004"
    },
    {
      "key": "mailpitUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8025"
    },
    {
      "key": "providerOrderId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "orcamentoVersao",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "4. Billing — orçamento",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "E-mail do orçamento recebido (Mailpit, kind)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mailpitUrl}}/api/v1/messages?limit=10",
              "host": [
                "{{mailpitUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "messages"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10"
                }
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "O Billing envia o orçamento para aprovação por e-mail. No kind, os e-mails ficam no Mailpit (UI em {{mailpitUrl}})."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar orçamento",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{billingBaseUrl}}/orcamentos/{{orcamentoId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{billingBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "orcamentos",
                "{{orcamentoId}}"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{clienteToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.version) pm.collectionVariables.set('orcamentoVersao', String(json.version));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Aprovar orçamento (cliente)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{billingBaseUrl}}/orcamentos/{{orcamentoId}}/aprovar",
              "host": [
                "{{billingBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "orcamentos",
                "{{orcamentoId}}",
                "aprovar"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{clienteToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"versao\": {{orcamentoVersao}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Recusar orçamento (cliente) — dispara compensação",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{billingBaseUrl}}/orcamentos/{{orcamentoId}}/recusar",
              "host": [
                "{{billingBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "orcamentos",
                "{{orcamentoId}}",
                "recusar"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{clienteToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"versao\": {{orcamentoVersao}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Billing — cobrança e pagamento",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cobrança da OS (QR Mercado Pago)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{billingBaseUrl}}/cobrancas/por-os/{{osId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{billingBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cobrancas",
                "por-os",
                "{{osId}}"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{clienteToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.id || json.chargeId) pm.collectionVariables.set('cobrancaId', json.id || json.chargeId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar cobrança",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{billingBaseUrl}}/cobrancas/{{cobrancaId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{billingBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cobrancas",
                "{{cobrancaId}}"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{clienteToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Simulador: localizar a order da cobrança",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mpSimuladorUrl}}/simulador/ordens",
              "host": [
                "{{mpSimuladorUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "simulador",
                "ordens"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Somente no kind sem credenciais do Mercado Pago: o simulador da Orders API guarda a order criada pelo Billing."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const orders = pm.response.json();",
                  "const charge = pm.collectionVariables.get('cobrancaId');",
                  "const order = orders.find((item) => item.external_reference === charge) || orders[0];",
                  "if (order) pm.collectionVariables.set('providerOrderId', order.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Simulador: comprador paga o QR (webhook assinado ao Billing)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mpSimuladorUrl}}/simulador/pagamentos/{{providerOrderId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{mpSimuladorUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "simulador",
                "pagamentos",
                "{{providerOrderId}}"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Aprova o pagamento no simulador, que envia o webhook assinado ao Billing; o Billing confirma o pagamento e a OS passa a PAGAMENTO_CONFIRMADO. Com credenciais de teste, pague o QR com o comprador de teste do Mercado Pago."
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Com Mercado Pago de teste, o pagamento é feito no app com o comprador de teste e o webhook assinado chega ao Billing (POST /webhooks/mercado-pago). No kind sem credenciais, use os dois passos do simulador abaixo."
    },
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Billing /health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{billingBaseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{billingBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}